FTP with OpenSSL: the module ftp of php74-ftp built with FTP over SSL
(ftp_ssl_connect()) on the OpenSSL of the base system. The same files as
php74-ftp: install one of the two.

The module ftp of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20190902/ftp.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d, its headers in
include/php74/php/ext/ftp.
